  "summary": "Gateway profile for the Carlo Gavazzi EM21 three-phase meter: 44 Analog Inputs, 31 polled by default. It reads line-neutral and line-line voltages, phase currents, W, VA and VAR per phase and in total, PF, phase sequence, frequency and imported kWh/kvarh.",
